      {"id":"R14:P:README:SIMULATOR_OBJECTIVE_PRINCIPLE","role":"METHODOLOGY_OR_TEST_PROTOCOL","content":"Compare systems with and without Omega_t -> Delta Gspace_{t+1}; test consequence-shaped evolution of adaptive mechanism spaces rather than generic feedback-performance improvement."},
